name: ['Abrade', 'Academy Ruins', 'Accomplished Automaton', 'Ad Nauseam', 'Adaptive Automaton', 'Alabaster Mage', 'Ancestral Blade', 'Ancient Stirrings', 'Angel of the Dawn', 'Apprentice Wizard', 'Archangel of Thune', 'Arcum Dagsson', 'Argivian Restoration', 'Arixmethes, Slumbering Isle', 'Ash Barrens', "Atraxa, Praetors' Voice", 'Auriok Salvagers', 'Austere Command', 'Avacyn, Angel of Hope', 'Avenger of Zendikar', 'Awakening Zone', 'Balduvian Rage', 'Baleful Strix', 'Basalt Monolith', 'Basilisk Collar', 'Batterskull', 'Battle-Rattle Shaman', 'Beacon of Unrest', 'Blade Splicer', 'Blasphemous Act', 'Blightsteel Colossus', 'Blinkmoth Nexus', 'Blood Moon', 'Bloodbriar', 'Bloodshot Trainee', 'Bloodspore Thrinax', 'Bone Picker', 'Boon Reflection', 'Bosh, Iron Golem', 'Braids, Conjurer Adept', 'Brainstorm', 'Breya, Etherium Shaper', 'Brimstone Volley', 'Brudiclad, Telchor Engineer', 'Buried Ruin', 'Cascade Bluffs', 'Cast Down', 'Cathartic Reunion', 'Cathodion', 'Champion of Lambholt', 'Chatter of the Squirrel', 'Chief of the Foundry', 'Chord of Calling', 'Chromatic Star', 'Chrome Mox', 'Clear Shot', 'Clone Shell', 'Cloudreader Sphinx', 'Cogwork Assembler', 'Conclave Naturalists', "Conjurer's Closet", 'Coretapper', 'Corridor Monitor', 'Costly Plunder', "Council's Judgment", 'Cragganwick Cremator', 'Cranial Plating', 'Crib Swap', 'Crop Rotation', 'Crusader of Odric', 'Crushing Vines', 'Culling Dais', 'Cyclonic Rift', 'Dark Confidant', 'Dark Depths', 'Darksteel Axe', 'Darksteel Citadel', 'Darksteel Forge', "Death's Shadow", 'Death-Hood Cobra', 'Deathreap Ritual', 'Deepglow Skate', 'Defiant Salvager', 'Dire Fleet Hoarder', 'Disciple of Bolas', 'Disciple of the Vault', 'Dismantle', 'Divest', 'Doomed Necromancer', 'Doubling Season', 'Dread Return', 'Driver of the Dead', 'Drown in Sorrow', 'Dualcaster Mage', 'Duplicant', 'Eager Construct', 'Elvish Aberration', 'Endless Atlas', 'Engineered Explosives', 'Enlarge', 'Ensnaring Bridge', 'Esperzoa', 'Ethersworn Canonist', 'Everflowing