an enters or leaves the battlefield, choose a land of each basic land type, then destroy those lands.', 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'When Thopter Engineer enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\nArtifact creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', 'When Thraben Inspector enters the battlefield, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'When Treasure Keeper dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card with mana value 3 or less. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Put all revealed cards not cast this way on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Treasure Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Veteran Explorer dies, each player may search their library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When Well of Ideas enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\nAt the beginning of each other player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.\nAt the beginning of your draw step, draw two additional cards.", 'Whenever Hammer of Nazahn or another Equipment enters the battlefield under your control, you may attach that Equipment to target creature you control.\nEquipped creature gets +2/+0 and has indestructible.\nEquip {4}', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, you may add an amount of {C} equal to the number of creatures you control that share a creature type with it.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\nWhenever you sacrifice a Clue, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token.', "Whenever a permanent becomes untapped, that permanent's controller mills a card.", 'Whenever a player taps a land for mana, that player adds one mana of any type that land produced.', 'Whenever an Equipment enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.\nMetalcraft — Equipment you control have equip {0} as long as you control three or more artifacts.', 'Whenever an artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Salivating Gremlins gets +2/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Whenever an artifact enters the battlefield under your control, you may return Ovalchase Daredevil from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever an artifact is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may have target opponent lose 1 life.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a spell during your turn or when Voice of Resurgence dies, create a green and white Elemental creature token with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control."', "Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control, Glassdust Hulk gets +1/+1 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.\nCycling {W/U} ({W/U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Whenever one or more tokens enter the battlefield under your control, put that many +1/+1 counters on Woodland Champion.', 'Whenever you cast a historic spell, draw a card. (Artifacts, legendaries, and Sagas are historic.)', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may have target creature get +2/+0 and gain deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature token.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may pay {U}{R}. If you do, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\nWhenever another nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {G}{U}. If you do, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", 'Whenever you sacrifice another permanent, put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodbriar.', "Will of the council — Starting with you, each player votes for a nonland permanent you don't control. Exile each permanent with the most votes or tied for most votes.", 'You may have Masterwork of Ingenuity enter the battlefield as a copy of any Equipment on the battlefield.', 'You may have Progenitor Mimic enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it has "At the beginning of your upkeep, if this creature isn\'t a token, create a token that\'s a copy of this creature."', 'You may have Sculpting Steel enter the battlefield as a copy of any artifact on the battlefield.', "You may pay 1 life and exile a blue card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nCounter target spell.", 'You may play an additional land on each of your turns.', "You may sacrifice three artifacts rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nExile three artifact cards from your graveyard: Return Salvage Titan from your graveyard to your hand.", "[+2]: Look at the top card of target player's library. You may put that card on the bottom of that player's library.\n[0]: Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.\n[−1]: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\n[−12]: Exile all cards from target player's library, then that player shuffles their hand into their library.", '[+4]: Target player exiles a card from their hand.\n[−3]: Exile target permanent.\n[−14]: Restart the game, leaving in exile all non-Aura permanent cards exiled with Karn Liberated. Then put those cards onto the battlefield under your control.', "{0}: Attach target Equipment you control to Kazuul's Toll Collector. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{1}, Sacrifice a nontoken artifact: Create a 1/1 blue Thopter artifact creature token with flying. You gain 1 life.', '{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Chromatic Star: Add one mana of any color.\nWhen Chromatic Star is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', "{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Executioner's Capsule: Destroy target nonblack creature.", '{1}{G}: Death-Hood Cobra gains reach until end of turn.\n{1}{G}: Death-Hood Cobra gains deathtouch until end of turn.', '{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter or a charge counter from a permanent you control: Ion Storm deals 2 damage to any target.', '{1}{W}: Return target artifact card with mana value 1 or less from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{W}: Target creature you control gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', '{1}{W}{U}, {T}: Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Expedition Map: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control three or more lands with the same name.', '{2}: Target artifact creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\n{2}: Target artifact creature gains your choice of flying, trample, or haste until end of turn.', '{2}{B}, {T}, Exile Magus of the Will: Until end of turn, you may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard. If a card would be put into your graveyard from anywhere this turn, exile that card instead.', "{2}{G/W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green and white Elf Warrior creature token.\n{4}{G/W}{G/W}, {T}: For each creature token you control, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}: Put a fate counter on target permanent.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Oblivion Stone: Destroy each nonland permanent without a fate counter on it, then remove all fate counters from all permanents.', "{7}: Create a token that's a copy of target artifact. That token gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Doomed Necromancer: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}, Sacrifice Pyrite Spellbomb: It deals 2 damage to any target.\n{1}, Sacrifice Pyrite Spellbomb: Draw a card.', '{R}, {T}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Grim Lavamancer deals 2 damage to any target.', '{R}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. That creature gains haste. Sacrifice the creature at the beginning of the next end step.', "{T}, Sacrifice Mishra's Bauble: Look at the top card of target player's library. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a charge counter on Culling Dais.\n{1}, Sacrifice Culling Dais: Draw a card for each charge counter on Culling Dais.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Orcish Vandal deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', '{T}, Sacrifice five artifacts: Take an extra turn after this one.', '{T}, Sacrifice three artifacts: Search your library for an artifact card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}: Blinkmoth Nexus becomes a 1/1 Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying until end of turn. It's still a land.\n{1}, {T}: Target Blinkmoth creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}: Mishra's Factory becomes a 2/2 Assembly-Worker artifact creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\n{T}: Target Assembly-Worker creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{U}, {T}: Put target artifact card from your graveyard on top of your library.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Buried Ruin: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of target land, except it has this ability.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}: Investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{B/G}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{G}, or {G}{G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{B/R}, {T}: Add {B}{B}, {B}{R}, or {R}{R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{G/U}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{U}, or {U}{U}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{G/W}, {T}: Add {G}{G}, {G}{W}, or {W}{W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{R/G}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{G}, or {G}{G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{R/W}, {T}: Add {R}{R}, {R}{W}, or {W}{W}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{U/B}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{B}, or {B}{B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{U/R}, {T}: Add {U}{U}, {U}{R}, or {R}{R}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{W/B}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{B}, or {B}{B}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{W/U}, {T}: Add {W}{W}, {W}{U}, or {U}{U}.', "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {C}{C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", '{T}: Add {G}.\nFerocious — {T}: Add {G}{G}. Activate only if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "{T}: Bloodshot Trainee deals 4 damage to target creature. Activate only if Bloodshot Trainee's power is 4 or greater.", '{T}: Put a charge counter on Lux Cannon.\n{T}, Remove three charge counters from Lux Cannon: Destroy target permanent.', '{T}: Put a charge counter on Ratchet Bomb.\n{T}, Sacrifice Ratchet Bomb: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Ratchet Bomb.', '{T}: Put a charge counter on target artifact.\nSacrifice Coretapper: Put two charge counters on target artifact.', "{T}: Target artifact creature's controller sacrifices it. That player may search their library for a noncreature artifact card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", '{T}: Untap target attacking creature. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.', '{U/P}: Change a target of target spell or ability to Spellskite. ({U/P} can be paid with either {U} or 2 life.)', "{U}, {T}, Return an artifact you control to its owner's hand: You may put an artifact card from your hand onto the battlefield.", '{U}, {T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.']
